# Contact

Import Layout.

## Page /contact

Head:
    <title>Contact — Acme</title>

View:
    {extends Site}
    {block content:}
      <h1 id="title">Contact</h1>
      <p id="body">reach us at hello@acme.example</p>
    {end}

## Test: the layout wraps the page and marks Contact active

Expect that the text of "#title" is equal to "Contact".
Expect that the count of "nav a" is equal to 3.
Expect that the count of "nav a.active" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "nav a.active" is equal to "Contact".
